{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astar Solis</i> is a meditation app like no other. Free your mind and enter a trance-like state by means of the ancient mystical practice of <i>&lt;checks notes&gt;</i> dodging bullets in space. Yeah, that's right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This <span class=\"bb_strike\">game</span>...\u00a0<i>uh</i>, meditation app... features infinite lives, the goal simply being: survive the current onslaught, usually for 2 minutes, without getting hit. Dip in and out of the path to enlightenment at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalistic, no-nonsense 2D shooter. For the authentic experience, a controller is highly recommended.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936480?t=1757402933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936480?t=1757402933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936480/21894613ab35da5ab4ab0243ae18eb7df46156d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757402933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936480/21894613ab35da5ab4ab0243ae18eb7df46156d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757402933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astar Solis</i> is a meditation app like no other. Free your mind and enter a trance-like state by means of the ancient mystical practice of <i>&lt;checks notes&gt;</i> dodging bullets in space. Yeah, that's right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This <span class=\"bb_strike\">